WEBVTT

00:30.883 --> 00:34.433
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.453 --> 00:37.833
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.103 --> 00:44.073
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.233 --> 00:48.863
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.883 --> 00:52.393
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.413 --> 00:55.903
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.923 --> 00:59.433
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.453 --> 01:05.513
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.773 --> 01:23.053
Si Jin

01:23.073 --> 01:27.573
Episode 7

01:31.353 --> 01:33.333
- Chief.
- Qi.

01:33.353 --> 01:34.683
Chief, Chuchu is here.

01:34.683 --> 01:36.133
Chuchu is here, Chief.

01:36.153 --> 01:37.513
Qi.

01:38.663 --> 01:39.523
Chief, Chief.

01:39.523 --> 01:40.713
Hurry, Chuchu is here!

01:40.713 --> 01:42.073
Qi.

01:43.883 --> 01:45.243
Qi.

01:45.843 --> 01:47.773
Chief, are you here?

01:47.793 --> 01:48.633
Qi.

01:48.643 --> 01:50.223
Are you here, Chief?

01:50.243 --> 01:51.603
Stop!

01:56.643 --> 01:58.283
Chuchu.

01:58.593 --> 01:59.903
Long time no see.

01:59.923 --> 02:02.193
Surprised? Unexpected?

02:04.683 --> 02:06.283
So surprised.

02:07.753 --> 02:09.443
What brings you to Ling'an?

02:10.523 --> 02:11.873
I've been traveling around,

02:11.873 --> 02:12.883
upholding justice,

02:12.883 --> 02:15.203
and before I knew it,
I ended up in Ling'an.

02:15.593 --> 02:16.923
Maybe it's fate,

02:16.923 --> 02:18.473
sensing that you needed me.

02:18.493 --> 02:20.083
As expected, as soon as I saw Long Dan,

02:20.083 --> 02:21.853
I heard you were badly injured.

02:21.873 --> 02:23.723
Let me see. Where are you hurt?

02:25.843 --> 02:27.203
Let go.

02:28.523 --> 02:29.883
Chuchu,

02:30.203 --> 02:31.763
it's been so many years.

02:32.033 --> 02:34.483
Can't you think of yourself
as a young lady?

02:36.123 --> 02:37.773
What should a young lady do?

02:44.273 --> 02:45.593
A young lady should follow rules,

02:45.593 --> 02:47.063
stay away from men,

02:47.083 --> 02:48.913
and get married when she's of age.

02:53.363 --> 02:54.883
I got it.

02:55.083 --> 02:57.503
You must've been pressured
into marriage,

02:57.523 --> 02:58.913
so you ran away.

02:59.433 --> 03:00.683
I have feet.

03:00.683 --> 03:02.113
I can leave anytime.

03:02.403 --> 03:04.683
This is walking freely in the world.

03:04.683 --> 03:06.043
Good for you.

03:12.313 --> 03:13.673
Miss Jiang.

03:14.203 --> 03:15.723
Chuchu.

03:16.993 --> 03:18.513
Why are you here?

03:18.713 --> 03:20.103
I live next door,

03:20.123 --> 03:22.793
so I came by to check on Commandant Yu.

03:23.033 --> 03:24.783
You mean Qi?

03:24.803 --> 03:26.533
He's inside. Come with me.

03:26.553 --> 03:28.623
Are you friends?

03:28.643 --> 03:29.763
Not only that.

03:29.783 --> 03:31.143
My father is also in the military.

03:31.153 --> 03:32.823
We grew up together.

03:32.843 --> 03:33.993
Even our martial arts master

03:33.993 --> 03:35.383
was the same.

03:35.403 --> 03:36.453
But later,

03:36.473 --> 03:38.413
Qi formed the Chiyu Cavalry

03:38.433 --> 03:39.733
and went to a new camp.

03:39.753 --> 03:41.333
That's when we parted ways.

03:42.033 --> 03:43.623
(No wonder I've never seen her.)

03:43.643 --> 03:45.103
(She's really straightforward.)

03:45.123 --> 03:46.033
(Yu Qi's been hiding)

03:46.033 --> 03:47.663
(the Chiyu Cavalry, )

03:47.683 --> 03:48.803
(but it took her no time)

03:48.803 --> 03:50.723
(to tell me everything.)

03:50.873 --> 03:51.713
Miss Jiang,

03:51.713 --> 03:53.563
how do you know Qi?

03:54.593 --> 03:55.953
Because...

03:56.173 --> 03:57.823
Because of official business.

03:58.713 --> 03:59.593
Then I'll take you in.

03:59.593 --> 04:01.193
OK, let's go.

04:02.523 --> 04:03.883
Qi,

04:03.933 --> 04:05.703
Miss Jiang is here to see you.

04:08.393 --> 04:09.233
Commandant Yu.

04:09.233 --> 04:10.843
Miss Jiang, please sit.

04:12.233 --> 04:14.083
I won't get up to greet you.

04:14.083 --> 04:15.523
Don't get up.

04:15.643 --> 04:17.353
Based on your condition now,

04:17.353 --> 04:19.743
you need a few more days
to recover from the poison.

04:19.763 --> 04:21.403
But I need to report

04:21.403 --> 04:23.433
to Capital Security asap,

04:23.713 --> 04:26.113
or Mr. Zhen will think

04:26.323 --> 04:27.693
I'm faking,

04:27.713 --> 04:29.383
just staying here enjoying

04:29.403 --> 04:31.063
the fine food you brought.

04:31.083 --> 04:31.963
You have to rest

04:31.963 --> 04:33.553
for a couple of more days.

04:33.713 --> 04:35.073
Aman.

04:37.793 --> 04:39.033
I made pigeon soup

04:39.033 --> 04:40.523
for you today.

04:44.523 --> 04:46.203
Miss Jiang, he's fine.

04:46.203 --> 04:47.823
You don't have to feed him.

04:48.083 --> 04:49.003
Qi,

04:49.003 --> 04:49.963
what's wrong with you?

04:49.963 --> 04:51.333
Just now, you were fine.

04:51.353 --> 04:52.203
You wanted me to...

04:52.203 --> 04:53.563
No.

04:53.793 --> 04:54.893
Don't take care of me.

04:54.913 --> 04:56.273
I can handle it.

04:58.673 --> 04:59.693
Chuchu,

04:59.713 --> 05:01.253
how long will you stay in Ling'an?

05:01.273 --> 05:02.713
I didn't plan to stay long,

05:02.713 --> 05:04.773
but since I ran into Qi and Long Dan,

05:04.793 --> 05:06.403
I thought I'd stay a little longer.

05:06.403 --> 05:08.643
Qi, will you find me annoying?

05:11.593 --> 05:12.953
Of course not.

05:14.443 --> 05:15.453
That's good.

05:15.473 --> 05:16.863
Then we can hang out more.

05:16.883 --> 05:18.243
OK.

05:18.643 --> 05:20.083
Chuchu, go check

05:20.083 --> 05:22.323
if the medicine Long Dan bought for me

05:22.343 --> 05:23.403
- has arrived.
- Medicine?

05:23.403 --> 05:24.763
Give it to me.

05:24.883 --> 05:25.843
Thank you, Miss Jiang.

05:25.843 --> 05:27.203
My pleasure.

05:31.473 --> 05:32.873
Here, Mr. Yu.

05:33.763 --> 05:35.523
I'll try it myself.

05:36.403 --> 05:37.993
Can you handle it?

05:38.083 --> 05:39.443
I can.

05:45.203 --> 05:46.563
Let me.

05:48.323 --> 05:49.963
Thank you, Miss Jiang.

06:07.883 --> 06:09.743
You got hurt because of me.

06:09.763 --> 06:10.673
It's only right

06:10.673 --> 06:12.093
that I take care of you.

06:12.113 --> 06:13.943
It's also a way for me

06:13.963 --> 06:15.433
to make up for it.

06:17.593 --> 06:18.653
By the way, Mr. Yu,

06:18.673 --> 06:21.283
what would you like to eat tomorrow?

06:22.203 --> 06:23.563
Tasty.

06:24.113 --> 06:25.553
Anything tasty will do.

06:33.693 --> 06:39.093
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

06:55.733 --> 06:59.253
(Rongyang, Dazhou's Grand Princess)

07:00.643 --> 07:01.493
Mother.

07:01.493 --> 07:03.813
(Cui Mingyue, Rongyang's daughter)
Come in.

07:03.833 --> 07:05.893
(Graceful and Dignified)
The Marquis is coming?

07:05.913 --> 07:07.273
Mingyue,

07:07.353 --> 07:08.473
have you heard

07:08.473 --> 07:10.433
about Marquis Changxing's Mansion?

07:10.673 --> 07:12.183
Of course.

07:12.203 --> 07:13.273
They dug up

07:13.273 --> 07:15.313
over a dozen corpses

07:15.353 --> 07:17.213
in the mansion at once.

07:17.233 --> 07:18.503
Such shocking news

07:18.523 --> 07:19.643
spread throughout Ling'an

07:19.643 --> 07:21.213
in no time.

07:21.233 --> 07:22.593
Your Grace.

07:27.153 --> 07:28.513
Mother.

07:28.883 --> 07:31.383
How shameless Marquis Changxing is.

07:31.403 --> 07:32.863
His son is so disgraceful,

07:32.883 --> 07:35.283
yet he wanted me to be
his daughter-in-law.

07:35.913 --> 07:37.273
Mingyue,

07:37.763 --> 07:40.083
how many times have I told you

07:40.443 --> 07:43.043
to be more respectful
to Marquis Changxing?

07:43.203 --> 07:44.643
When Nanwu

07:44.913 --> 07:46.543
invaded us,

07:46.563 --> 07:48.093
he and your father

07:48.113 --> 07:49.993
defended the country together.

07:50.083 --> 07:52.603
He served the country

07:54.083 --> 07:57.203
and once helped us.

07:58.113 --> 07:58.963
So, Mother,

07:58.963 --> 08:01.403
how are you going to save Cao Xingyu?

08:02.403 --> 08:04.083
Do you have a good plan?

08:10.443 --> 08:12.083
If you personally intervene

08:12.083 --> 08:13.743
as the Grand Princess,

08:13.763 --> 08:16.083
the Capital Security
will surely let him go.

08:16.113 --> 08:17.273
The dead are

08:17.273 --> 08:19.403
just lowly women.

08:19.423 --> 08:20.443
If we give their families

08:20.443 --> 08:22.183
some generous compensation,

08:22.203 --> 08:23.573
everything will be

08:23.593 --> 08:25.143
deescalated, right?

08:25.163 --> 08:27.273
How did you come up with this?

08:27.993 --> 08:29.923
I'm so clever!

08:30.393 --> 08:33.203
You are too naive.

08:33.753 --> 08:34.713
In the future,

08:34.713 --> 08:36.713
I'll have your uncle help you find

08:36.713 --> 08:39.213
the best man in the world.

08:39.233 --> 08:40.203
But first,

08:40.203 --> 08:41.873
I have to test him.

08:41.923 --> 08:43.633
Only then

08:43.683 --> 08:45.923
can I feel at ease.

08:46.843 --> 08:48.333
Mother, you're the best.

08:51.273 --> 08:53.043
The Marquis seeks an audience.

08:54.163 --> 08:55.523
Marquis Changxing.

09:01.753 --> 09:02.973
Your Highness,

09:02.993 --> 09:05.903
this is Golden Branch and Jade Leaf.

09:05.923 --> 09:08.063
The branches are made of gold,

09:08.083 --> 09:10.213
the flowers are made
of mutton-fat white jade,

09:10.233 --> 09:13.063
and the leaves are made
of high-quality emerald.

09:13.083 --> 09:14.963
I managed to get it with great effort

09:14.963 --> 09:16.453
from Lingnan.

09:16.473 --> 09:18.683
It's for Your Highness.

09:19.233 --> 09:21.113
You came late at night

09:21.473 --> 09:23.603
because of your son, right?

09:23.843 --> 09:25.903
How insightful you are.

09:25.923 --> 09:27.323
Zhen Heng from the Capital Security,

09:27.323 --> 09:29.163
and Yu Qi, the new Commandant,

09:29.163 --> 09:31.283
are bold and reckless,

09:31.283 --> 09:33.353
disrespecting me completely.

09:33.353 --> 09:34.563
They fabricated

09:34.563 --> 09:36.083
some nonsensical reason

09:36.083 --> 09:37.673
to imprison my son.

09:37.673 --> 09:39.283
They even want to sentence him to death.

09:39.283 --> 09:40.443
Your Highness,

09:40.563 --> 09:42.393
you must stand for me.

09:42.393 --> 09:44.393
Is this charge something you made up,

09:44.393 --> 09:45.453
or is it true?

09:45.473 --> 09:46.613
Your Highness,

09:46.633 --> 09:48.663
everything I said is true.

09:48.683 --> 09:50.783
I wouldn't dare fabricate it.

09:50.803 --> 09:53.303
Your Highness, you know

09:53.323 --> 09:58.083
he's my only son.

09:58.513 --> 10:00.373
You ask me for help,

10:00.393 --> 10:02.233
yet you won't tell the truth.

10:02.633 --> 10:05.153
How am I supposed to help you?

10:06.633 --> 10:07.993
I...

10:14.653 --> 10:16.693
(Court, Capital Security)

11:05.683 --> 11:07.873
Chief, how's your hand?

11:08.443 --> 11:09.423
It's fine.

11:09.443 --> 11:10.843
Take a look at this.

11:10.883 --> 11:12.683
When we searched
Marquis Changxing's Mansion,

11:12.683 --> 11:13.753
we found whips

11:13.753 --> 11:14.593
and this

11:14.613 --> 11:16.483
in the secret chamber.

11:17.083 --> 11:18.853
I've asked Miss Chi about it.

11:18.873 --> 11:20.323
Cao Xingyu calls this drug

11:20.323 --> 11:22.693
Surreal Wander.

11:22.713 --> 11:24.563
Before abusing them every time,

11:24.563 --> 11:27.033
he would take one of them.

11:27.113 --> 11:29.033
- This drug...
- Open it.

11:32.393 --> 11:33.423
This drug

11:33.443 --> 11:35.153
is effective.

11:43.443 --> 11:44.993
How could he even take this?

11:44.993 --> 11:45.963
Go ask the physician.

11:45.963 --> 11:47.563
Does he have some chronic illness?

11:47.563 --> 11:49.323
I've already asked.

11:49.323 --> 11:50.683
He...

11:53.563 --> 11:55.283
This drug...

11:55.283 --> 11:57.323
Come on, spit it out.

11:58.563 --> 12:00.033
It's an aphrodisiac.

12:03.043 --> 12:04.563
One of the ingredients

12:04.563 --> 12:06.303
is a plant called bianteng.

12:06.323 --> 12:08.693
It only grows in Nanwu.

12:08.713 --> 12:10.093
The physician said

12:10.113 --> 12:11.713
he had only seen this

12:11.713 --> 12:13.513
when Dazhou and Nanwu

12:13.513 --> 12:14.663
were still trading,

12:14.683 --> 12:16.963
but now it's banned.

12:23.593 --> 12:25.373
Looks like Cao Xingyu

12:25.393 --> 12:28.353
is guilty of more than just murder.

12:28.643 --> 12:30.543
I was just worrying
about having no leads,

12:30.563 --> 12:32.423
and now it's been delivered to me.

12:32.683 --> 12:34.203
Report!

12:34.593 --> 12:35.573
Mr. Yu.

12:35.593 --> 12:36.443
Mr. Zhen.

12:36.443 --> 12:37.963
Outside...

12:37.963 --> 12:39.723
Go take a look.

12:41.203 --> 12:43.393
What do Speed Guards do?

12:43.393 --> 12:45.453
They're directly
under the Emperor's command

12:45.473 --> 12:47.943
to investigate the people
and monitor the officials,

12:47.963 --> 12:50.233
with more power than us.

12:51.083 --> 12:52.723
The person who came today

12:52.873 --> 12:54.753
is Commander Han Ran.

12:56.393 --> 12:57.753
Impressive.

12:58.713 --> 13:00.273
Mr. Han.

13:03.713 --> 13:04.673
Mr. Han.

13:04.693 --> 13:06.973
(Han Ran, Speed Guards Commander)

13:06.993 --> 13:08.483
Marquis,

13:08.513 --> 13:11.333
Grand Princess asked me to tell you

13:11.353 --> 13:14.263
that she's aware of the situation
with the Capital Security.

13:14.283 --> 13:15.903
Please rest assured.

13:15.923 --> 13:17.693
Grand Princess said

13:17.713 --> 13:19.853
you were a loyal general of the country,

13:19.873 --> 13:22.173
and helping you was helping Dazhou.

13:22.193 --> 13:23.673
(Luxurious and Gorgeous)
Her Highness

13:23.673 --> 13:24.943
also said your son

13:24.963 --> 13:27.603
would have to leave Ling'an

13:27.683 --> 13:29.563
after this.

13:33.963 --> 13:36.023
Please tell Her Highness

13:36.043 --> 13:38.613
I'll send my rebellious son far away.

13:38.633 --> 13:41.063
He'll never come back.

13:41.083 --> 13:43.063
(Court)
I came today

13:43.083 --> 13:45.023
for a man

13:45.043 --> 13:46.563
at the Capital Security.

13:46.563 --> 13:47.663
Who?

13:47.683 --> 13:49.603
Marquis Changxing's heir,

13:49.753 --> 13:51.443
Cao Xingyu.

13:53.203 --> 13:55.613
He is a major criminal in our office.

13:55.633 --> 13:57.323
The case has not been concluded.

13:57.343 --> 13:59.193
I'm afraid he can't go with you.

13:59.633 --> 14:01.153
What a coincidence.

14:01.513 --> 14:03.143
Cao Xingyu is also involved

14:03.163 --> 14:05.443
in a case that we've been investigating

14:05.443 --> 14:07.033
for many years.

14:07.163 --> 14:12.033
It's about treason with Nanwu.

14:13.353 --> 14:14.723
Mr. Han,

14:15.043 --> 14:16.923
do you have any official documents?

14:26.043 --> 14:27.663
I'm afraid

14:27.683 --> 14:29.263
your vague words

14:29.283 --> 14:31.373
can't convince anyone.

14:31.393 --> 14:34.493
Mr. Yu, you've just taken office,

14:34.513 --> 14:35.903
so you don't know about us.

14:35.923 --> 14:37.693
The cases handled by Speed Guards

14:37.713 --> 14:39.423
are confidential.

14:39.443 --> 14:41.633
It's about the case.

14:41.873 --> 14:43.723
Nothing can be disclosed.

14:44.353 --> 14:45.713
Well,

14:46.293 --> 14:48.063
I've got many matters to attend to.

14:48.083 --> 14:49.303
Please

14:49.323 --> 14:51.323
bring Cao Xingyu here now

14:51.323 --> 14:52.923
and hand him over to me.

14:53.203 --> 14:54.733
Cao Xingyu

14:54.753 --> 14:57.733
has killed a dozen people.

14:57.753 --> 14:59.373
He's a heinous criminal.

14:59.393 --> 15:01.563
We haven't concluded the case.

15:01.563 --> 15:04.063
If you want to take him away

15:04.083 --> 15:06.093
without any explanation,

15:06.113 --> 15:07.513
I'm afraid

15:07.683 --> 15:10.493
we can't cooperate.

15:10.513 --> 15:12.843
You serve the Emperor,

15:12.843 --> 15:16.303
but this is also a serious case.

15:16.323 --> 15:17.233
Everything

15:17.233 --> 15:19.543
has to follow the proper order.

15:19.563 --> 15:22.083
Since we captured him first,

15:22.083 --> 15:25.603
we should be the ones
to interrogate him first.

15:34.283 --> 15:36.693
Miss Chi is safe here.

15:36.713 --> 15:38.073
Rest assured.

15:39.103 --> 15:40.863
I've heard
about the Speed Guards' actions

15:40.863 --> 15:42.123
this afternoon.

15:42.163 --> 15:43.523
Thank you.

15:50.233 --> 15:51.333
This really is

15:51.353 --> 15:53.083
troubling you.

15:54.163 --> 15:55.603
It's nothing.

15:56.323 --> 15:59.113
I just didn't expect there to be a spy.

16:00.323 --> 16:01.903
Miss Chi is inside.

16:01.923 --> 16:03.143
You can go in now.

16:03.163 --> 16:04.233
I won't go with you.

16:04.233 --> 16:06.483
OK, I'll go check on her.

16:13.593 --> 16:14.953
Come here.

16:15.283 --> 16:16.713
This afternoon,

16:16.713 --> 16:17.683
Aman...

16:17.683 --> 16:19.923
Did you get the documents from Han Ran?

16:28.753 --> 16:30.753
You rest. I'll go.

16:33.473 --> 16:34.853
Don't let me rest.

16:34.873 --> 16:36.143
By the way, Miss Chi,

16:36.163 --> 16:37.393
do you need to send a letter

16:37.393 --> 16:39.263
to your family first?

16:39.283 --> 16:40.493
No need.

16:40.513 --> 16:42.033
I have no family.

16:42.283 --> 16:44.333
I was orphaned as a child,

16:44.353 --> 16:46.623
and my brother
and sister-in-law took me in,

16:46.833 --> 16:48.193
but they

16:48.353 --> 16:50.513
sold me to a brothel.

16:50.593 --> 16:51.803
Miss Si,

16:51.803 --> 16:53.703
they don't care about family at all.

16:53.723 --> 16:56.443
They only care about their interests.

16:56.953 --> 16:59.073
When I settled down in the suburbs,

16:59.093 --> 17:01.373
my brother and sister-in-law
heard about it

17:01.393 --> 17:03.273
and rushed there overnight.

17:03.523 --> 17:04.823
I thought

17:04.843 --> 17:07.923
they were guilty and remorseful,

17:08.633 --> 17:09.993
but...

17:10.723 --> 17:12.703
I was such a fool.

17:12.723 --> 17:15.703
How could I still expect
anything from them?

17:15.723 --> 17:17.173
What are you saying?

17:17.193 --> 17:18.433
You want me to marry Cao Xingyu

17:18.433 --> 17:20.363
as a concubine?

17:23.113 --> 17:24.723
Sister,

17:24.843 --> 17:26.823
in your situation now,

17:26.843 --> 17:28.833
who would want you?

17:29.433 --> 17:32.483
That's Marquis Changxing's heir.

17:33.083 --> 17:35.233
The dowries they sent

17:35.393 --> 17:37.173
have filled our courtyard.

17:37.193 --> 17:38.413
When I married

17:38.433 --> 17:39.763
your brother,

17:39.763 --> 17:41.083
it wasn't even this grand.

17:41.083 --> 17:42.833
Once you marry the heir,

17:43.193 --> 17:44.563
who would dare spread rumors

17:44.563 --> 17:46.413
about your innocence?

17:46.433 --> 17:49.613
We are thinking of you.

17:49.633 --> 17:51.313
Thinking of me?

17:58.243 --> 17:59.983
Before our parents passed away,

18:00.003 --> 18:01.993
they entrusted me to you,

18:02.113 --> 18:04.443
but you sold me to a brothel.

18:05.193 --> 18:07.553
That's not enough, right?

18:08.913 --> 18:11.463
So, you want me to suffer more, huh?

18:11.483 --> 18:14.173
I was forced back then.

18:14.193 --> 18:15.123
This is

18:15.143 --> 18:16.263
such a good opportunity.

18:16.283 --> 18:18.553
I want you to have a good life.

18:20.193 --> 18:21.893
Looking back,

18:21.913 --> 18:23.353
since they sold me

18:23.353 --> 18:24.653
to the brothel,

18:24.673 --> 18:25.933
I actually

18:25.953 --> 18:28.063
lost my family.

18:28.083 --> 18:29.463
Miss Chi,

18:29.483 --> 18:31.223
when you escaped danger,

18:31.243 --> 18:33.003
you still risked your life

18:33.003 --> 18:34.463
to save others.

18:34.483 --> 18:36.703
With such courage and spirit,

18:36.723 --> 18:38.793
there's no obstacle you can't overcome.

18:39.393 --> 18:41.073
You taught me that.

18:41.283 --> 18:42.173
Miss Jiang,

18:42.193 --> 18:44.303
you saved me without asking
for anything in return.

18:44.323 --> 18:45.893
I will also follow your example

18:45.913 --> 18:47.703
and help others

18:47.723 --> 18:48.953
in need.

18:48.953 --> 18:49.893
Rest assured.

18:49.913 --> 18:51.743
With Commandant Yu and Mr. Zhen,

18:51.763 --> 18:52.853
the truth of this case

18:52.873 --> 18:54.883
will definitely come to light.

18:57.043 --> 18:58.643
Thank you, Miss Jiang.

18:58.813 --> 19:03.573
(Capital Security)

19:04.633 --> 19:06.033
Cao Xingyu,

19:06.563 --> 19:08.243
are you planning

19:08.243 --> 19:10.223
to stay silent forever?

19:10.243 --> 19:12.033
Open your eyes and take a look.

19:14.113 --> 19:15.643
This thing

19:16.323 --> 19:18.723
was found in your study.

19:18.843 --> 19:21.073
It's called Surreal Wander, right?

19:27.283 --> 19:29.413
What Surreal Wander?

19:29.433 --> 19:30.593
I've never heard of it.

19:30.593 --> 19:32.833
Never heard of it?

19:33.043 --> 19:35.273
Then it's not yours.

19:37.083 --> 19:39.753
Could it be your father's?

19:40.383 --> 19:41.243
Shut up.

19:41.243 --> 19:42.933
Fine, I won't talk about this.

19:43.563 --> 19:44.873
Your father is so old.

19:44.873 --> 19:46.043
This is... Wow.

19:46.043 --> 19:47.743
- Yu Qi!
- Fine.

19:47.763 --> 19:49.123
Let's not mention it.

19:49.803 --> 19:51.613
Let's talk about something else.

19:53.723 --> 19:55.723
Is this formula

19:55.953 --> 19:58.073
from Nanwu?

19:59.043 --> 20:00.913
I never imagined

20:00.913 --> 20:03.893
that one day your family

20:03.913 --> 20:05.893
would collude with Nanwu

20:05.913 --> 20:08.363
and commit treason.

20:10.003 --> 20:11.403
Yu Qi,

20:11.913 --> 20:13.133
I'm telling you.

20:13.153 --> 20:15.593
Don't you dare slander my family.

20:17.563 --> 20:19.783
It was found in my study?

20:19.803 --> 20:22.163
You're just framing me.

20:22.433 --> 20:23.793
Good.

20:23.913 --> 20:24.953
Based on your reaction,

20:24.953 --> 20:26.503
I'm relieved.

20:26.523 --> 20:27.883
I believe you.

20:29.673 --> 20:31.033
Show him.

20:32.433 --> 20:34.033
(Cao Xingyu, Marquis Changxing's heir, )

20:34.043 --> 20:36.153
(is suspected of colluding with Nanwu.)

20:37.723 --> 20:39.123
What does this mean?

20:39.523 --> 20:41.843
You've been in the prison,

20:41.843 --> 20:43.743
so it's normal for you not to know.

20:45.483 --> 20:47.963
Speed Guards came earlier.

20:48.113 --> 20:49.913
They wanted to take you away

20:49.913 --> 20:51.573
on charges of colluding with Nanwu.

20:51.593 --> 20:52.983
Cao Xingyu

20:53.003 --> 20:55.643
was manipulated by Nanwu

20:55.723 --> 20:58.593
to kill and bury the corpses.

20:58.763 --> 20:59.603
Nanwu?

20:59.623 --> 21:00.723
According to Speed Guards'

21:00.723 --> 21:02.263
years of investigation,

21:02.283 --> 21:03.873
Nanwu has sent spies

21:03.873 --> 21:05.153
into Ling'an

21:05.153 --> 21:07.063
and formed the Nightingale Division,

21:07.083 --> 21:09.303
targeting our high-ranking officials

21:09.323 --> 21:12.153
to gather intel
and turn them against us.

21:12.153 --> 21:15.793
Marquis Changxing is our top general,

21:15.843 --> 21:18.063
with significant power in the military,

21:18.083 --> 21:20.363
and he also guards the Imperial City.

21:20.633 --> 21:22.263
They repeatedly tested him

21:22.283 --> 21:23.883
but made no progress,

21:23.903 --> 21:25.113
so they focused their attention

21:25.113 --> 21:27.153
on his son, Cao Xingyu.

21:27.153 --> 21:28.933
They used drugs to control him,

21:28.953 --> 21:30.593
forcing him to commit murder.

21:31.113 --> 21:32.793
If this drug

21:32.873 --> 21:35.443
can control Cao Xingyu,

21:36.003 --> 21:38.793
why not directly control his father?

21:41.633 --> 21:42.523
This is

21:42.523 --> 21:44.323
Nanwu's tactic.

21:44.323 --> 21:45.543
They want to turn

21:45.563 --> 21:48.063
Marquis Changxing

21:48.083 --> 21:50.273
against His Majesty.

21:53.083 --> 21:54.443
What?

21:55.083 --> 21:57.963
Are you trying to stop us

21:58.043 --> 21:59.193
from taking away

21:59.193 --> 22:00.703
our suspect?

22:00.723 --> 22:01.823
Today,

22:01.843 --> 22:02.803
you must hand over

22:02.803 --> 22:04.683
Cao Xingyu,

22:04.703 --> 22:05.763
whether you want to or not.

22:05.763 --> 22:06.633
If we refuse,

22:06.633 --> 22:08.513
will you fight us?

22:08.843 --> 22:10.593
Aren't you afraid I'll report this

22:10.593 --> 22:11.853
to His Majesty?

22:11.873 --> 22:13.233
Go ahead.

22:14.633 --> 22:17.203
Go and report it.

22:17.873 --> 22:19.633
If you bring His Majesty's

22:19.633 --> 22:21.413
handwritten edict today,

22:21.433 --> 22:22.573
you can

22:22.593 --> 22:23.433
take him away.

22:23.433 --> 22:24.703
Otherwise,

22:24.723 --> 22:26.263
don't think about it.

22:26.283 --> 22:27.643
Three days.

22:29.223 --> 22:30.783
You have only three days.

22:30.873 --> 22:31.723
You don't know

22:31.723 --> 22:33.433
how hard I worked

22:33.433 --> 22:35.313
to protect you.

22:36.763 --> 22:38.163
You should know

22:38.843 --> 22:40.083
the consequences

22:40.083 --> 22:41.513
if they get evidence

22:41.763 --> 22:43.593
like this.

22:51.153 --> 22:52.283
What do you want?

22:52.283 --> 22:54.363
It's not about me.

22:54.633 --> 22:57.793
It's about your explanation.

22:58.003 --> 23:01.273
Where did the drug come from?

23:01.293 --> 23:04.453
(Nightingale Division Stronghold)

23:22.973 --> 23:28.293
(Sang Qi, a nightingale spy)

23:46.953 --> 23:49.643
The Saintess appears; Nanwu thrives.

23:52.723 --> 23:55.233
Senior, it's so late.

23:55.393 --> 23:56.403
What's wrong?

23:56.403 --> 23:58.773
(Du'er, Leader of Nightingale Division)

23:58.773 --> 23:59.913
The Marquis Changxing's case

23:59.913 --> 24:02.233
has been causing
quite a stir these days.

24:02.323 --> 24:03.683
I heard

24:03.913 --> 24:06.313
they had clues about Nanwu.

24:06.333 --> 24:08.503
The Marquis's mansion
is under your watch.

24:08.523 --> 24:09.503
What's going on?

24:09.523 --> 24:11.753
Senior, listen.

24:12.273 --> 24:14.783
Cao Xingyu is a lustful man.

24:14.803 --> 24:16.133
I planned to use this

24:16.153 --> 24:18.173
to make him our new pawn

24:18.193 --> 24:20.403
in Ling'an.

24:20.913 --> 24:23.403
But he's extremely foolish.

24:23.423 --> 24:24.483
After torturing and killing

24:24.483 --> 24:25.723
a dozen women,

24:25.723 --> 24:28.273
he hid the bodies in his own garden.

24:28.873 --> 24:30.573
But don't worry.

24:30.593 --> 24:32.933
He was imprisoned for murder.

24:32.953 --> 24:34.743
There's no connection to Nanwu.

24:35.393 --> 24:36.433
However, my spy

24:36.433 --> 24:38.513
in Speed Guards told me

24:38.673 --> 24:41.613
that Han Ran was planning
to take him away

24:41.633 --> 24:43.753
on charges of treason with Nanwu.

24:44.673 --> 24:45.563
I'm sure

24:45.563 --> 24:47.503
it's just a pretext
Marquis Changxing made up

24:47.523 --> 24:48.933
to save his son.

24:48.953 --> 24:50.993
There's no real evidence.

24:51.873 --> 24:53.023
Senior,

24:53.043 --> 24:55.203
you know how I work.

24:55.283 --> 24:56.153
I never leave behind

24:56.153 --> 24:58.163
the slightest trace.

25:06.433 --> 25:09.263
Our division has been lurking
in Ling'an for ten years

25:09.283 --> 25:11.173
to have this underground network

25:11.193 --> 25:13.363
and hiding places.

25:14.243 --> 25:16.553
Right now, the Saintess is missing,

25:17.153 --> 25:19.363
and Dazhou hasn't fallen.

25:20.043 --> 25:22.443
The road ahead is still long,

25:23.043 --> 25:25.133
so every step must be steady.

25:25.153 --> 25:26.513
Yes.

25:28.393 --> 25:29.843
So, you're confident

25:29.843 --> 25:31.873
that you can erase the Surreal Wander

25:31.873 --> 25:33.483
before I discover it?

25:34.563 --> 25:36.063
Senior, please calm down.

25:36.953 --> 25:38.833
It happened so suddenly.

25:39.003 --> 25:40.003
We didn't have time

25:40.003 --> 25:41.893
to retrieve it
from the Marquis's mansion

25:41.913 --> 25:44.923
before the Capital Security searched it.

25:49.483 --> 25:51.093
Proceed with caution.

25:51.113 --> 25:52.463
Don't get us implicated.

25:52.483 --> 25:53.843
Yes.

25:55.153 --> 25:56.513
Senior,

25:56.563 --> 25:58.393
should I directly

25:58.393 --> 25:59.133
silence Cao Xingyu

25:59.153 --> 26:00.283
to eliminate future trouble?

26:00.283 --> 26:01.263
No need.

26:01.283 --> 26:02.983
Cao Xingyu is already useless.

26:03.003 --> 26:04.823
No need to waste another move.

26:04.843 --> 26:06.093
Remember.

26:06.113 --> 26:08.373
The more you do,
the more mistakes you make.

26:08.393 --> 26:09.703
Yes.

26:09.723 --> 26:11.083
Leave.

26:16.393 --> 26:18.173
What will the Capital Security do

26:18.523 --> 26:20.513
about Cao Xingyu's case?

26:21.323 --> 26:22.683
Will they let him go

26:23.523 --> 26:25.123
or execute him?

26:29.323 --> 26:31.363
There's a good show coming up.

26:31.483 --> 26:32.803
What do you think?

26:32.803 --> 26:34.113
Does this case have any connection

26:34.113 --> 26:36.173
to the Nightingale Division?

26:36.193 --> 26:38.703
They're in the dark,
while we're in the light.

26:38.723 --> 26:40.263
They must be waiting

26:40.283 --> 26:41.243
to see how we will

26:41.243 --> 26:43.073
end this show.

26:43.953 --> 26:46.503
Cao Xingyu's guilt is indisputable.

26:46.523 --> 26:47.743
If we release him,

26:47.763 --> 26:49.483
the souls of the murdered women

26:49.483 --> 26:51.413
will never have justice.

26:51.433 --> 26:52.893
The Capital Security

26:52.913 --> 26:54.833
will lose all credibility.

26:54.853 --> 26:55.913
(Court)
If we execute him,

26:55.913 --> 26:58.363
Marquis Changxing
will lose his only son

26:58.803 --> 27:01.353
so he'll harbor resentment
towards the court

27:01.353 --> 27:02.653
and develop ill intentions.

27:02.673 --> 27:04.683
So, no matter what we choose,

27:04.803 --> 27:06.223
it will benefit them

27:06.243 --> 27:08.503
without backfiring.

27:08.523 --> 27:10.593
What a poisonous strategy.

27:10.803 --> 27:12.233
Now,

27:13.113 --> 27:15.123
we truly are in a dilemma.

27:17.523 --> 27:20.513
So, Mr. Zhen, what will you do?

27:24.193 --> 27:25.703
Mozi once said

27:25.723 --> 27:27.173
that the law is necessary

27:27.193 --> 27:28.923
to rule the country.

27:29.143 --> 27:31.573
Only when all people,
noble or humble, follow the law

27:31.593 --> 27:33.833
can peace be achieved.

27:34.243 --> 27:35.603
So,

27:36.763 --> 27:39.643
following your heart
and adhering to the law

27:39.723 --> 27:42.233
is the correct solution to this problem.

27:50.763 --> 27:51.983
Miss Jiang,

27:52.003 --> 27:53.653
the wrongdoer should be punished.

27:53.673 --> 27:54.913
Should we just stand by

27:54.913 --> 27:56.993
and watch that villain go free?

27:57.113 --> 27:58.153
Should my daughter

27:58.153 --> 28:01.643
die without justice?

28:02.153 --> 28:04.833
Ms. Xiu, please calm down.

28:05.483 --> 28:07.003
I have thought of a method,

28:07.003 --> 28:08.573
but it's a bit risky.

28:08.593 --> 28:09.483
I'm not sure

28:09.483 --> 28:11.313
if you're willing to try.

28:11.483 --> 28:12.843
Commandant Yu,

28:13.193 --> 28:14.933
among the generals in Ling'an,

28:14.953 --> 28:17.373
few are as wise, courteous,

28:17.393 --> 28:19.063
and eloquent as you.

28:19.083 --> 28:21.023
You must've read many books.

28:21.043 --> 28:23.343
May I ask who your master was?

28:23.363 --> 28:25.063
Why did you choose to study martial arts

28:25.083 --> 28:26.753
instead of literature?

28:27.483 --> 28:29.723
That's a long story.

28:30.193 --> 28:31.843
For now, we should focus

28:31.843 --> 28:33.853
on how to handle this case.

28:33.873 --> 28:36.203
Even if we rule impartially,

28:36.223 --> 28:37.613
we have to end it in three days.

28:37.633 --> 28:39.323
If they come to take him then,

28:39.323 --> 28:41.033
we'll have to hand him over.

28:42.113 --> 28:44.783
When they get Cao Xingyu,

28:44.803 --> 28:47.513
the testimony might change,

28:47.673 --> 28:50.963
and they might find a Nanwu scapegoat.

28:51.873 --> 28:53.363
Then the trial

28:53.483 --> 28:54.823
would be meaningless.

28:54.843 --> 28:56.363
You're right.

28:57.953 --> 29:00.073
What should we do?

29:00.763 --> 29:03.033
We should have His Majesty
preside over the trial.

29:03.053 --> 29:05.713
We should ask His Majesty
to preside over the trial.

29:14.383 --> 29:16.093
Candied hawthorn.

29:17.093 --> 29:18.283
Sir, have a look.

29:18.283 --> 29:19.743
We're in a bustling market.

29:19.763 --> 29:20.953
You must not be seen.

29:20.953 --> 29:22.783
(Eunuch Liu from the Palace)
What if someone

29:22.803 --> 29:24.163
recognizes you?

29:27.953 --> 29:29.313
Wait.

29:29.523 --> 29:30.883
Stop.

29:31.483 --> 29:32.843
Your Majesty.

29:33.913 --> 29:35.273
Master.

29:35.323 --> 29:37.273
Go buy a cold drink.

29:37.433 --> 29:38.493
We're traveling incognito,

29:38.493 --> 29:40.243
so we didn't bring many guards with us.

29:40.243 --> 29:42.393
Only the Capital Security
is patrolling secretly.

29:42.393 --> 29:43.523
It's unnecessary to me.

29:43.523 --> 29:45.443
Stop talking and go buy it.

29:45.563 --> 29:46.923
Yes.

29:52.353 --> 29:53.373
Get me one.

29:53.393 --> 29:54.753
Sure.

29:55.953 --> 29:57.313
Take care.

30:04.593 --> 30:05.953
Master.

30:11.113 --> 30:12.473
Let's go.

30:27.593 --> 30:28.783
Your Majesty,

30:28.803 --> 30:30.023
I've been wronged.

30:30.043 --> 30:32.513
Please seek justice for me.

30:35.523 --> 30:36.883
Take her away.

30:38.193 --> 30:39.113
Your Majesty!

30:39.113 --> 30:40.483
Wait.

30:57.953 --> 30:58.843
Ma'am.

30:58.853 --> 31:00.983
(Emperor Jingming of Dazhou)
Continue.

31:01.003 --> 31:01.893
Your Majesty,

31:01.913 --> 31:04.373
I had no other choice

31:04.393 --> 31:06.543
but to risk my life and appeal to you.

31:06.563 --> 31:08.783
Please seek justice for me.

31:08.803 --> 31:09.873
Please give justice

31:09.873 --> 31:11.553
to my deceased daughter.

31:12.673 --> 31:13.893
Why not report it?

31:13.913 --> 31:15.783
The Capital Security wouldn't help?

31:18.113 --> 31:20.513
The murderer holds a high position

31:20.633 --> 31:22.363
and can cover up everything.

31:22.393 --> 31:24.523
My daughter isn't the only victim.

31:24.523 --> 31:27.413
He killed over a dozen young girls
of similar age.

31:27.433 --> 31:28.433
The Capital Security

31:28.433 --> 31:30.063
only just arrested him,

31:30.083 --> 31:31.573
but before the case is closed,

31:31.593 --> 31:33.553
someone is already intervening.

31:34.593 --> 31:36.643
It's likely he'll be released

31:37.003 --> 31:39.073
in a few days.

31:40.043 --> 31:42.203
Who is so audacious?

31:42.353 --> 31:44.503
Cao Xingyu,

31:44.523 --> 31:46.273
Marquis Changxing's heir.

31:50.153 --> 31:51.803
(Graceful and Dignified)
I never expected

31:51.803 --> 31:53.463
something to go wrong with my son.

31:53.483 --> 31:54.783
Sorry for the trouble.

31:54.803 --> 31:56.913
Your Highness, you are influential.

31:56.913 --> 31:57.913
Your words matter.

31:57.933 --> 32:00.223
I hope you can help me once more.

32:00.243 --> 32:02.273
If I can overcome this obstacle,

32:03.763 --> 32:06.243
I will follow your lead

32:06.243 --> 32:07.633
without hesitation.

32:07.633 --> 32:09.643
You've become too greedy.

32:10.633 --> 32:12.933
I was deceived by you before,

32:12.953 --> 32:14.353
so I tried to help out of goodwill.

32:14.353 --> 32:16.303
That's the limit of my kindness.

32:16.323 --> 32:19.263
Yet your son committed a heinous crime.

32:19.283 --> 32:21.833
Perhaps this is his fate.

32:22.353 --> 32:23.713
Marquis,

32:24.353 --> 32:28.363
it's time to accept your fate.

32:35.113 --> 32:36.473
Fate?

32:37.723 --> 32:39.683
Is this my fate?

32:43.243 --> 32:44.673
I beg your pardon for my rudeness.

32:44.673 --> 32:45.673
Now, don't you think

32:45.673 --> 32:47.843
it's too late for you

32:47.843 --> 32:49.353
to distance yourself from me?

32:49.353 --> 32:51.723
If you accidentally caused harm,

32:51.723 --> 32:53.783
then that too is your fate,
Your Highness.

32:53.803 --> 32:56.033
Since you're ungrateful,

32:56.633 --> 32:57.783
fine.

32:57.803 --> 32:59.593
Present it to the Marquis.

33:01.913 --> 33:03.113
Your son

33:03.113 --> 33:04.933
traded the intelligence of Dazhou

33:04.953 --> 33:06.723
for Surreal Wander

33:06.723 --> 33:08.563
with Nanwu's Nightingale Division

33:08.563 --> 33:10.593
to satisfy his lust.

33:11.633 --> 33:12.593
Impossible.

33:12.593 --> 33:13.923
This is impossible!

33:13.943 --> 33:15.043
My son, however outrageous,

33:15.043 --> 33:16.593
would never do such a thing.

33:16.593 --> 33:18.273
This must be slander!

33:18.763 --> 33:20.233
It's fine.

33:20.563 --> 33:22.553
Speed Guards

33:23.083 --> 33:25.443
have many letters like this.

33:26.283 --> 33:27.853
Whether it's a misunderstanding

33:27.873 --> 33:29.593
is clear in the letters.

33:31.523 --> 33:33.723
Your Highness, I deserve to die.

33:33.723 --> 33:35.463
Please forgive me.

33:35.483 --> 33:37.173
Please tell me

33:37.193 --> 33:39.123
what I should do.

33:40.723 --> 33:42.833
This is a farce.

33:43.003 --> 33:44.413
It's time for it to end.

33:44.433 --> 33:46.643
Although my son is rebellious,

33:47.283 --> 33:48.843
he's still my only son.

33:48.843 --> 33:49.683
Your Highness!

33:49.693 --> 33:52.273
If it were just a dozen young women,

33:53.003 --> 33:56.123
the most it'd cost
is the life of the heir.

33:56.913 --> 33:59.333
But this is treason.

33:59.353 --> 34:01.183
Your entire family

34:01.203 --> 34:03.193
cannot be spared.

34:12.873 --> 34:14.963
What's more important?

34:15.913 --> 34:17.763
Do I need to say more?

34:20.243 --> 34:21.783
Since you

34:21.803 --> 34:23.163
brought this treasure

34:23.163 --> 34:25.053
(Graceful and Dignified)
from Lingnan,

34:25.073 --> 34:27.933
I cannot take this from you.

34:27.953 --> 34:29.663
I've admired it enough.

34:29.683 --> 34:31.993
It's time for you to take it back.

34:37.393 --> 34:41.073
Golden Branch and Jade Leaf.

34:41.553 --> 34:45.283
Just as the name suggests.

34:58.853 --> 35:03.133
(Tiande Hall, Palace)

35:04.553 --> 35:05.913
Your Majesty.

35:14.993 --> 35:16.823
With both witness and physical evidence,

35:16.843 --> 35:18.663
what can you argue?

35:18.683 --> 35:20.043
Father.

35:20.643 --> 35:22.003
Father.

35:22.953 --> 35:23.873
Your Majesty, I...

35:23.873 --> 35:25.233
Your Majesty.

35:25.643 --> 35:26.853
I'm guilty.

35:26.873 --> 35:28.343
Do not speak recklessly.

35:28.343 --> 35:29.503
Cao Yong.

35:30.483 --> 35:32.933
A father should be responsible
for his ill-bred child.

35:32.953 --> 35:34.823
Since my son was young,

35:34.843 --> 35:37.583
whenever his father
was unsatisfied with him,

35:37.603 --> 35:39.713
he'd receive a cruel beating.

35:39.873 --> 35:42.243
I was weak and useless,

35:42.283 --> 35:44.323
so I failed to stop him.

35:45.203 --> 35:46.783
As his parents, we bear great sin

35:46.803 --> 35:49.603
for what he's done.

35:49.603 --> 35:50.953
Enough! Shut up!

35:50.953 --> 35:52.963
Don't you dare hit my mother!

35:56.803 --> 35:58.163
Your Majesty,

35:58.553 --> 36:01.183
we failed to teach our child,

36:01.203 --> 36:03.453
so he has gone astray.

36:03.473 --> 36:05.073
Your Majesty,

36:05.323 --> 36:07.183
please

36:07.203 --> 36:09.073
spare his life.

36:09.353 --> 36:10.373
Mother.

36:10.393 --> 36:11.233
Mother.

36:11.243 --> 36:12.603
Mother.

36:13.033 --> 36:14.393
Mother.

36:16.683 --> 36:20.103
If I show mercy to the heir,

36:20.123 --> 36:21.963
what will happen to the law?

36:35.723 --> 36:37.593
A life for a life.

36:40.243 --> 36:42.113
Before I came here,

36:42.803 --> 36:44.283
I poisoned myself.

36:45.073 --> 36:47.633
I hope my life

36:48.073 --> 36:50.413
can soothe the souls.

36:50.433 --> 36:51.703
Mother.

36:51.723 --> 36:52.893
Mother.

36:52.913 --> 36:53.823
Mother!

36:53.843 --> 36:55.203
Mother, I'm sorry.

36:55.203 --> 36:57.673
Mother, Mother!

36:57.873 --> 36:59.883
Mother!

37:22.073 --> 37:24.033
Spread His Majesty's decree:

37:24.073 --> 37:26.123
Cao Xingyu, Marquis Changxing's heir,

37:26.123 --> 37:28.763
kidnapped common women, abused his wife,

37:28.763 --> 37:31.333
and trampled on human life.
His crimes are unforgivable.

37:31.353 --> 37:33.593
He will be executed after the autumn.

37:33.913 --> 37:36.353
Cao Yong, Marquis Changxing,
failed to educate his son.

37:36.353 --> 37:38.053
Considering his military achievements,

37:38.073 --> 37:39.323
his title will be retained

37:39.323 --> 37:41.743
but will not be inherited.

37:41.763 --> 37:45.033
The decree becomes effective
upon arrival.

37:48.133 --> 37:52.653
(Tiande Hall)

37:53.073 --> 37:54.163
How considerate of you.

37:54.163 --> 37:55.263
I'm sorry.

37:55.283 --> 37:56.123
How did she manage

37:56.123 --> 37:57.623
to tell me this?

37:57.643 --> 37:58.973
How did she recognize me

37:58.973 --> 38:00.033
among all those palanquins

38:00.033 --> 38:01.493
in the street?

38:01.513 --> 38:02.873
I shouldn't have

38:03.033 --> 38:05.143
used my position in the Capital Security

38:05.163 --> 38:06.033
to force Your Majesty

38:06.033 --> 38:07.743
to interrogate Marquis Changxing's heir.

38:07.763 --> 38:09.713
This trial today

38:09.953 --> 38:12.143
has cost Marquis Changxing his heir

38:12.163 --> 38:13.163
and his wife.

38:13.163 --> 38:15.263
Do you know who Marquis Changxing is?

38:15.283 --> 38:16.713
I do.

38:17.433 --> 38:18.373
In terms of loyalty,

38:18.393 --> 38:20.443
you two have risked your lives

38:20.723 --> 38:21.933
to serve the country.

38:21.953 --> 38:23.553
In the court,

38:23.603 --> 38:25.103
he's one of your trusted officials.

38:25.123 --> 38:26.743
Today, Your Majesty's actions

38:26.763 --> 38:28.673
have chilled his heart.

38:29.163 --> 38:30.533
In the future,

38:30.553 --> 38:32.553
he may never again serve the country.

38:32.683 --> 38:33.603
But, Your Majesty,

38:33.603 --> 38:35.483
I had no other choice.

38:35.723 --> 38:37.843
What's more important, a dozen lives

38:37.843 --> 38:39.163
or the Marquis's son

38:39.163 --> 38:41.303
who should've been punished?

38:41.323 --> 38:43.073
I'm too short-sighted

38:43.323 --> 38:44.763
to think of something better.

38:44.763 --> 38:46.223
Are you saying

38:46.243 --> 38:48.363
I can't tell right from wrong

38:48.553 --> 38:50.683
and I can't tell
which is more important,

38:50.683 --> 38:52.353
a dozen lives or Cao Yong's son?

38:52.353 --> 38:54.363
Of course, Your Majesty can tell,

38:54.513 --> 38:55.703
so you are

38:55.723 --> 38:57.553
so painful right now.

39:02.723 --> 39:05.023
(Since I returned to the 23rd year
of Jingming, )

39:05.043 --> 39:07.333
(Qiaoniang and Ji Chongyi
have got married, )

39:07.353 --> 39:09.283
(and Cao Xingyu's been imprisoned.)

39:09.553 --> 39:11.363
(Everything has changed.)

39:11.953 --> 39:13.213
(If that's the case, )

39:13.233 --> 39:14.853
(I can surely change the fate)

39:14.873 --> 39:16.183
(of my brother, )

39:16.203 --> 39:17.993
(sister, )

39:18.203 --> 39:20.483
(and father.)

39:24.723 --> 39:26.243
Commandant Yu,

39:26.433 --> 39:28.323
why didn't you enter the Palace?

39:29.243 --> 39:31.243
I just need to hear the result.

39:33.163 --> 39:35.053
I'm a little thirsty,

39:35.073 --> 39:36.393
so I came to see you

39:36.393 --> 39:38.153
for some water.

39:38.323 --> 39:40.403
Waiter, a cup of tea.

39:43.353 --> 39:45.193
Please enjoy.

39:48.033 --> 39:49.333
It's what everyone expected.

39:49.353 --> 39:51.713
The innocent women who died tragically

39:51.803 --> 39:53.623
can finally rest in peace.

39:53.643 --> 39:56.373
His mother committed suicide on the spot

39:56.393 --> 39:58.363
to atone for his sins.

39:59.723 --> 40:01.493
His mother is truly pitiful.

40:01.513 --> 40:03.073
For the sake of her son,

40:03.163 --> 40:04.663
she killed herself as an apology.

40:04.683 --> 40:06.153
Pitiful?

40:07.003 --> 40:08.283
Her son caused such a disturbance

40:08.283 --> 40:09.873
in the house.

40:09.873 --> 40:12.583
Her daughter-in-law
was beaten every day.

40:12.603 --> 40:14.803
As the mistress of the house,

40:15.073 --> 40:16.713
how could she know nothing?

40:17.513 --> 40:18.843
I think she must have

40:18.843 --> 40:20.963
turned a blind eye.

40:23.073 --> 40:24.393
No matter what,

40:24.393 --> 40:26.363
all mothers in the world

40:26.473 --> 40:28.413
love their children the most.

40:28.433 --> 40:30.263
Cao Xingyu's mother was like that,

40:30.283 --> 40:31.763
and so was my shrewd

40:31.763 --> 40:33.123
and calculating aunt.

40:33.843 --> 40:36.453
You've been in the Capital Security
for years.

40:36.473 --> 40:38.763
I know you very well.

40:39.033 --> 40:41.513
You could think of ways to seek justice

40:41.513 --> 40:42.853
for the lives of dozens,

40:42.873 --> 40:45.053
but you couldn't have that woman

40:45.073 --> 40:46.263
come to me.

40:46.283 --> 40:47.473
Don't tell me

40:47.473 --> 40:48.513
this was

40:48.513 --> 40:50.283
that woman's idea.

40:51.323 --> 40:53.193
Tell me. Who is it?

40:56.393 --> 40:57.493
Just tell me.

40:57.513 --> 40:59.363
I won't punish you.

40:59.843 --> 41:01.203
Your Majesty,

41:01.473 --> 41:02.643
I have a friend.

41:02.643 --> 41:04.743
Whenever I have difficulty
handling a case,

41:04.763 --> 41:06.713
I go to discuss it with him.

41:07.163 --> 41:08.523
He has a sharp sense of right

41:08.543 --> 41:10.623
and often thinks
of surprising solutions.

41:10.643 --> 41:12.003
This time,

41:12.073 --> 41:14.703
he came up with this idea for me.

41:14.723 --> 41:15.723
Is he

41:15.723 --> 41:17.083
serving in the court?

41:17.103 --> 41:18.203
Yes, he's the new commandant

41:18.203 --> 41:19.663
of the Capital Security,

41:19.683 --> 41:21.043
Yu Qi.

41:21.323 --> 41:22.993
Yu Qi?

41:24.953 --> 41:26.923
In this vast world,

41:27.033 --> 41:28.123
there are surely mothers

41:28.123 --> 41:29.733
who don't love their kids.

41:30.353 --> 41:32.363
Are you talking

41:33.163 --> 41:34.853
about your mother?

41:34.873 --> 41:37.323
I'm afraid I don't have that chance.

41:38.203 --> 41:39.623
The deceased is gone.

41:39.643 --> 41:40.783
My condolences, My Lord.

41:40.803 --> 41:42.163
You misunderstood.

41:43.953 --> 41:45.443
I'm saying

41:47.643 --> 41:49.553
I was abandoned as a child,

41:52.123 --> 41:53.203
and she never

41:53.203 --> 41:54.713
cared about me.

41:55.873 --> 41:57.853
So, in my heart,

41:57.873 --> 41:59.763
there's no such person.

42:00.643 --> 42:02.933
Then, over the years,

42:02.953 --> 42:04.923
you never looked for her?

42:05.353 --> 42:06.393
Perhaps back then,

42:06.393 --> 42:08.183
she had an unspoken reason.

42:08.203 --> 42:10.113
I never looked for her.

42:10.433 --> 42:12.483
Unspoken reason?

42:15.393 --> 42:17.333
A fortune-teller back then

42:17.353 --> 42:18.853
once said I was an unlucky child

42:18.873 --> 42:20.993
and would bring disaster to the family.

42:22.433 --> 42:25.033
Out of fear of being implicated
and losing favor,

42:25.683 --> 42:27.743
she came up with a plan

42:27.763 --> 42:29.033
to have my father

42:29.033 --> 42:30.583
send me far away.

42:30.603 --> 42:31.963
That's it.

42:35.243 --> 42:36.033
(Last time, )

42:36.053 --> 42:38.003
(The South)
(he refused to talk about this.)

42:38.023 --> 42:40.583
(I only know that he wasn't favored
by his relatives)

42:40.603 --> 42:42.593
(so he was exiled to the frontier.)

42:42.723 --> 42:43.853
(I never expected)

42:43.873 --> 42:46.153
(that he and I had such similar fates.)

42:46.203 --> 42:47.263
(From birth, )

42:47.283 --> 42:49.113
(we carried an ominous label.)

42:49.133 --> 42:53.333
(The End of Episode 7)

42:53.903 --> 42:55.633
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.633 --> 43:00.573
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.943 --> 43:03.323
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.323 --> 43:07.553
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.263 --> 43:10.663
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.683 --> 43:14.343
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.363 --> 43:17.783
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.933 --> 43:23.453
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.273 --> 43:27.953
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:27.953 --> 43:32.033
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.273 --> 43:34.013
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.033 --> 43:38.733
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.733 --> 43:42.303
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.323 --> 43:46.553
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.573 --> 43:48.353
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.353 --> 43:52.893
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.913 --> 43:57.713
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.943 --> 44:04.473
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.493 --> 44:08.113
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.133 --> 44:11.563
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.583 --> 44:16.203
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.203 --> 44:19.893
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.913 --> 44:24.003
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.113 --> 44:25.933
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.933 --> 44:30.483
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.503 --> 44:34.203
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.223 --> 44:38.383
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.563 --> 44:40.323
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.323 --> 44:44.843
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.843 --> 44:48.483
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.503 --> 44:54.173
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.863 --> 44:57.793
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.793 --> 45:05.293
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
